        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "今天我们就带大家一起去看一下，《房产点毛笔》是哪只制作出来的。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 42.28,
      "end": 46.813,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "毛笔的种类啊，有好多种，一般呢分为软毫笔、",
      "score": 0.0254,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1318,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1282,
        "sc_delta": 0.0036,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.056,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "毛笔的种类啊，有好多种。一般呢，分为圆毫笔。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 48.215,
      "end": 51.42,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "硬毫笔和兼毫笔三大类。软毫呢，",
