        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "大多数啊，用的是一戒一油两种墨搭配到一杯。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 65.032,
      "end": 68.28,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "以硬毫为核心，周边呢比软毫，",
